    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-wait-purpose",
        "moduleId": "problem-opening",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：父进程为什么需要等待",
        "markdown": "创建子进程后，系统中同时存在父进程和子进程，二者都可能被调度执行。有时父进程需要等子进程执行完毕才能继续，这项任务由 `wait()` 系统调用（或更完整的兄弟接口 `waitpid()`）承担。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000056"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统导论",
                "wait()系统调用"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1569,
              "lineEnd": 1616,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3dcfca84cc186c2e1e03c17fc12e6aaa3641d024a68c4e7e43c22286f0cf4497"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-wait-why",
        "moduleId": "problem-opening",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：把等待理解为阻塞",
        "markdown": "可以把 `wait()` 想成父进程取号等候：它并不替子进程干活，只是把自己挂起，直到内核通知它「你要等的子进程已经结束」。因此等待属于调度层面的阻塞，而不是父进程反复空转检查。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-wait-purpose"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-wait-mechanism",
        "moduleId": "wait-semantics",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：wait() 的阻塞与返回",
        "markdown": "在 `p2.c` 的例子中，父进程调用 `wait()`，延迟自己的执行，直到子进程执行完毕；当子进程结束时，`wait()` 才返回父进程。示例把返回值存入 `wc`，父进程打印出的 `wc` 值正是子进程的 PID。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000056"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统导论",
                "wait()系统调用"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1569,
              "lineEnd": 1616,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3dcfca84cc186c2e1e03c17fc12e6aaa3641d024a68c4e7e43c22286f0cf4497"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exit-status",
        "moduleId": "wait-semantics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：参数、状态与回收",
        "markdown": "`wait(NULL)` 中的 `NULL` 表示只关心「等到了」，不接收状态；更完整的 `waitpid()` 可以把退出状态写回调用者给出的地址。子进程结束、父进程尚未回收之前，它会以僵尸状态保留少量退出信息，调用等待接口正是回收这些信息的常规手段。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-wait-mechanism"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-boundary",
        "moduleId": "wait-semantics",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "模型补充：三个常见误解",
        "markdown": "误解一：以为 `wait()` 会让子进程开始运行；它不创建也不启动进程，只让调用者在子进程结束前保持阻塞。误解二：把 `wait()` 当成定时休眠；它的唤醒条件是子进程终止（或因信号等异常被打断），不是固定时间。误解三：以为任何情况下都会一直等；若没有可等待的子进程，`wait()` 通常立即返回错误值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-wait-mechanism",
            "model-exit-status"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-code-p2",
        "moduleId": "code-walkthrough",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：p2.c 的父分支调用 wait()",
        "markdown": "```c\nint rc = fork();\nif (rc < 0) {    // fork failed; exit\n    fprintf(stderr, \"fork failed\\n\");\n    exit(1);\n} else if (rc == 0) { // child (new process)\n    printf(\"hello, I am child (pid:%d)\\n\", (int) getpid());\n} else {    // parent goes down this path (main)\n    int wc = wait(NULL);\n    printf(\"hello, I am parent of %d (wc:%d) (pid:%d)\\n\",\n    rc, wc, (int) getpid());\n}\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000056"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统导论",
                "wait()系统调用"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1569,
              "lineEnd": 1616,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3dcfca84cc186c2e1e03c17fc12e6aaa3641d024a68c4e7e43c22286f0cf4497"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-code-walk",
        "moduleId": "code-walkthrough",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：逐行对照父子分支",
        "markdown": "代码用 `fork()` 的返回值分流：子进程（`rc == 0`）打印自己的信息后返回；父进程（`rc > 0`）先执行 `wait(NULL)` 再打印。父分支的 `wc` 与 `rc` 相等，说明 `wait()` 返回的正是被等待子进程的 PID。若不调用等待接口，两条打印语句的先后完全取决于调度器。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-code-p2",
            "tb-wait-mechanism"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-determinism",
        "moduleId": "determinism-analysis",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：先运行的父进程也会等待",
        "markdown": "教材指出：如果父进程碰巧先运行，它会马上调用 `wait()`；该系统调用在子进程运行结束后才返回。因此即使父进程先运行，它也会等待子进程运行完毕，然后 `wait()` 返回，接着父进程才输出自己的信息。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
